{"id":"acier","lemma":"acier","pos":"noun","rank":2598,"glosses":["steel"],"ipa":"/a.sje/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ae/Fr-acier.ogg/Fr-acier.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"aciers"},"formAudio":{"aciers":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Le_Commissaire-aciers.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Les pièges en acier sont illégaux.","en":"Steel traps are illegal.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"trap","l":"piège"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"illegal","l":"illégal"}]},{"text":"Les soldats portaient des casques en acier.","en":"The soldiers were wearing steel helmets.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"soldier","l":"soldat"},{"g":"to carry","l":"porter"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"helmet","l":"casque"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Tom doit avoir des nerfs d'acier.","en":"Tom must have nerves of steel.","words":[null,{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"nerve","l":"nerf"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"L'acier inoxydable ne rouille pas.","en":"Stainless steel doesn't rust.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"unoxidizable"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"rust"},{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"L'acier est recyclé à grande échelle.","en":"Steel is widely recycled.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to recycle","l":"recycler"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,7,"large-scale"]]}]}